{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-06T15:53:52.842Z","author":"codex-sol","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"af8be69532439927860300a8","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-06T15:53:52.841Z","author":"codex-sol","text":"Replaced the positive ExtensionApi capture mock with createExtensionTestHarness via the existing runtime fixture. Public assertCommandContract/assertExporter/assertServiceOverride and runCommand/runExporter/runServiceOverride now cover flags, both command names, schemaAddStatus plus PmClient.update on a real non-git tracker, stdout ownership and native storage preservation. No custom item schema or mutation hooks are registered; native schema/status roles and domain-specific Slack rendering remain covered. Intentional legacy-host test is retained. Revert/withdrawal proofs in a disposable copy: missing dry-run flag fails with missing --dry-run; missing alias fails registration; replacing the host tracker read with an empty list fails wip 0 versus 1; raw_stdout false fails true receipt assertion. Each control exits 1; restored implementation passes 6/6 smoke tests. This is a test-only migration, so these are behavioral negative controls rather than a production bugfix revert. Linked focused command passed 9/9 tests through pm test; lint, typecheck and build:test passed. Full npm/Bun gates and PR review follow."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-06T15:53:52.842Z"}],"before_hash":"f3e952242fe58154a166c251e308f27ddc81b012eea25a688a6001ef55e3c089","after_hash":"961f3dde6d96af58518bb17bae55d0a89fd379e41c86efee71d6b49ebb5a1a25","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_